The code in this package (the Terrain Diffusion model architecture) is copied
from the reference implementation of the InfiniteDiffusion paper:

    https://github.com/xandergos/terrain-diffusion
    commit e8dcb4b1a834ab2f6b1a6f5256ed7c9f2f3e8230

Copyright (c) 2025 Alexander Goslin. It is used and distributed under the
terms of the upstream MIT License, reproduced below.

The files copied are:
    mp_layers.py
    unet_block.py
    edm_unet.py
    edm_autoencoder.py
    perceptron.py

The pretrained weights loaded by the rest of this project come from the
authors' Hugging Face releases, e.g. xandergos/terrain-diffusion-30m, and
remain under the same upstream license.

